  "body": "THE WOODLAND PERCH \r\n\r\n(3 Sold - Dont Miss Out!) \r\n\r\nSome addresses simply don't repeat themselves.\r\n\r\nSet into the ridgeline between Mission Bay and St Heliers, The Woodland Perch is a boutique enclave of nine architecturally considered residences — seven standalone homes and a single duplex pair — each composed across three deliberate floors.\r\n\r\nOZAC-designed interiors. Bespoke kitchens. Statement media walls. HVAC, underfloor heating and integrated background sound, all standard — the kind of specification usually reserved for one-off custom builds.\r\n\r\nPerched above SEA-protected land, you're fifteen minutes from the city and moments from the Kohimarama waterfront: Rangitoto on the horizon and a beach that rewards you in every season.\r\n\r\nNow selling — Lots 3 to 8\r\n\r\nLots 3–5 | Standalone | 4 bed | 4.5 bath | 236.7m² | single garage\r\n\r\nLots 6–8 | Standalone | 4 bed | 4.5 bath | 280.2m² | single garage\r\n\r\nFour-bedroom configurations throughout, ranging from 236m² to 280m². With Lots 1, 2 and 9 now sold, six residences remain — a third of the collection already spoken for.\r\n\r\nThis is Eastern Bays living at its most elevated, in every sense of the word.\r\n\r\nEnquire for pricing and to arrange a private viewing.",
